Test: block-no-spaced-class-id >> invalid >>> invalid/block/space-around-comma
Filename: tests/fixtures/rules/block-no-spaced-class-id/invalid/block/space-around-comma-input.mmd

Code:
  1 | block
  2 |   A B
  3 |   classDef c fill:#f00
  4 |   class A , B c
    |           ^~~~~ [1]
  5 |

Output:
  1 | block
  2 |   A B
  3 |   classDef c fill:#f00
  4 |   class A,B c
  5 |

[1] mermaid.js ends the ids at the whitespace before the comma and takes the rest of the line as the name of the class, which no `classDef` defines.
